### ========================================================
### FinSight API Requests (Phase 1: Database & Auth)
### Base URL: http://localhost:4000
### ========================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@authToken = {{loginSuccess.response.body.data.token}}

### 0. Server Live Root Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### --------------------------------------------------------
### AUTHENTICATION: REGISTER
### --------------------------------------------------------

### 2. Register: Success (201 Created)
# @name registerSuccess
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@finsight.app",
  "password": "Password123",
  "name": "Aarav Sharma",
  "dob": "2008-05-15"
}

### 3. Register: Duplicate Email (409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@finsight.app",
  "password": "Password123",
  "name": "Aarav Sharma",
  "dob": "2008-05-15"
}

### 4. Register: Weak Password - No uppercase or numbers (422 Unprocessable)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "weakpass@finsight.app",
  "password": "password",
  "name": "Weak User",
  "dob": "2006-01-01"
}

### 5. Register: Under 13 Years Old (422 Unprocessable)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "too_young@finsight.app",
  "password": "Password123",
  "name": "Kid User",
  "dob": "2020-01-01"
}

### 6. Register: Invalid Future DOB (422 Unprocessable)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "time_traveler@finsight.app",
  "password": "Password123",
  "name": "Future User",
  "dob": "2099-01-01"
}

### --------------------------------------------------------
### AUTHENTICATION: LOGIN
### --------------------------------------------------------

### 7. Login: Success (200 OK)
# @name loginSuccess
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@finsight.app",
  "password": "Password123"
}

### 8. Login: Incorrect Password (401 Unauthorized - Generic Error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@finsight.app",
  "password": "WrongPassword999"
}

### 9. Login: Nonexistent Email (401 Unauthorized - Generic Error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nobody@finsight.app",
  "password": "Password123"
}

### --------------------------------------------------------
### USER PROFILE: GET /api/auth/me & PATCH /api/users/me
### --------------------------------------------------------

### 10. Get Current User Profile (200 OK - requires auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 11. Get Current User Profile: Missing Token (401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

### 12. Get Current User Profile: Malformed Token (401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token-string-xyz

### 13. Update User Profile: Valid ageGroup & name (200 OK)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ageGroup": "TEEN_ADVANCED",
  "name": "Aarav S."
}

### 14. Update User Profile: Invalid ageGroup Enum (422 Unprocessable)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ageGroup": "SENIOR_CITIZEN"
}

### 15. Update User Profile: Empty body with no fields (422 Unprocessable)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}


### --------------------------------------------------------
### PHASE 3: GAMIFICATION (DAILY CHECK-IN)
### --------------------------------------------------------

### 16. Daily Check-in: First of the day (+25 XP & streak updated)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/checkin
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 17. Daily Check-in: Duplicate on same day (no-op, 0 XP, alreadyCheckedIn: true)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/checkin
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### --------------------------------------------------------
### PHASE 3: LEARNING TOPICS & LESSONS
### --------------------------------------------------------

### 18. List All Topics (totalLessons, completedLessons, progress, nextLesson)
# @name getTopics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/topics
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 19. Get Stock Market Topic by Slug (with lesson statuses: available, locked)
# @name getStocksTopic
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/topics/stocks
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 20. Get Unknown Topic Slug (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/topics/non-existent-topic
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 21. Get Lesson 1: What is a Stock? (Available -> 200 OK with full content)
@lesson1Id = {{getStocksTopic.response.body.data.lessons[0].id}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/lessons/{{lesson1Id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 22. Get Lesson 2 Before Lesson 1 is Completed (403 Forbidden with code LESSON_LOCKED)
@lesson2Id = {{getStocksTopic.response.body.data.lessons[1].id}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/lessons/{{lesson2Id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 23. Complete Lesson 1: First attempt (Computes XP, awards badges, unlocks Lesson 2)
# @name completeLesson1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/lessons/{{lesson1Id}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quizAttempts": 1,
  "hintsUsed": 1
}

### 24. Complete Lesson 1: Replay / Double Submit (0 XP, alreadyCompleted: true)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/lessons/{{lesson1Id}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quizAttempts": 1,
  "hintsUsed": 0
}

### 25. Complete Lesson with Invalid Validation (attempts > 3 -> 422 Unprocessable)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/lessons/{{lesson1Id}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quizAttempts": 5,
  "hintsUsed": 0
}

### 26. Get Lesson 2 Now (Lesson 1 completed -> Available -> 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/lessons/{{lesson2Id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 27. Complete Lesson 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/lessons/{{lesson2Id}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quizAttempts": 2,
  "hintsUsed": 0
}

### 28. Complete Lesson 3 (Topic Finished -> +500 XP Topic Mastery Bonus & topic_master badge)
@lesson3Id = {{getStocksTopic.response.body.data.lessons[2].id}}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/lessons/{{lesson3Id}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quizAttempts": 1,
  "hintsUsed": 0
}

### --------------------------------------------------------
### PHASE 3: BADGES & HOME AGGREGATED DASHBOARD
### --------------------------------------------------------

### 29. List All Badges (returns all 12 badges with isEarned and earnedAt)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/badges
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 30. Get Home Aggregated Dashboard (user stats, continueLesson, topics progress, badges, latestNews)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/home
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### --------------------------------------------------------
### PHASE 7: NEWS HUB
### --------------------------------------------------------

### 31. List News Articles (All Categories, Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/news
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 32. List News Articles Filtered by Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/news?category=STOCK_MARKET&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 33. Get Specific News Article Detail (with Related Lesson Status)
# Replace with an actual article ID returned by list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/news/cm3samplearticleid
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 34. Mark News Article as Read (Idempotent +25 XP, max 5/day IST, evaluates badges)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/news/cm3samplearticleid/read
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
